; Module definition for my_xtension.dll — exports the X-Ways X-Tension entry
; points by their unmangled names. Rename LIBRARY to match your DLL filename.
;
; X-Ways drives behaviour off this export table: an exported no-op still gets
; called (export BOTH per-item callbacks and both fire per item — the "2N"
; trap). To turn a callback off, comment its line out here with ';' rather
; than stubbing it — the SDK's own samples model this (New.def exports only
; XT_Init). See docs/xtension-invocation.md.
LIBRARY my_xtension
EXPORTS
    XT_Init
    XT_About
    XT_Prepare
    XT_ProcessItem
    XT_ProcessItemEx
    XT_ProcessSearchHit
    XT_Finalize
    XT_Done
